{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "auth-onr-n8n-webhook-2026",
    "name": "Auth ONR — n8n Webhook",
    "description": "Coleção para consumir o workflow n8n **Auth ONR** (proxy de `LoginUsuarioCertificado`).\n\n## Pré-requisitos\n\n1. Workflow publicado ou em modo teste no n8n.\n2. Credenciais **HTTP Basic Auth** configuradas no nó Webhook do workflow.\n3. Campos do certificado — gere com:\n   ```bash\n   node scripts/extract_cert/extract_cert.js\n   node scripts/postman/export-postman-env.js\n   ```\n   Ou preencha manualmente o ambiente `Auth ONR n8n`.\n\n## URLs do webhook\n\n| Modo | Path | Quando usar |\n|------|------|-------------|\n| `webhook-test` | `/webhook-test/<uuid>` | Workflow aberto no editor + **Execute workflow** (teste) |\n| `webhook` | `/webhook/<uuid>` | Workflow **ativo** em produção |\n\nVariável `n8n_webhook_mode` controla qual prefixo usar.\n\n## Fluxo\n\n1. Importe esta coleção e o ambiente `Auth-ONR-n8n.postman_environment.template.json`.\n2. Preencha `N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER`, `N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD` e campos do certificado.\n3. Execute **Auth ONR — Login**.\n4. O script de testes grava `onr_tokens`, `onr_token` e `onr_hash`.\n\nDocumentação: `scripts/login/Auth WebService ONR.md`, `webservice/metodos/LoginUsuarioCertificado.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "n8n_base_url",
      "value": "https://n8n.ioshuavps.com.br",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "n8n_webhook_mode",
      "value": "webhook-test",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "n8n_webhook_id",
      "value": "163d6b2d-36fa-4c1c-bb1b-ed6085de7de2",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "onr_login_endpoint",
      "value": "https://hml3-wsoficio.onr.org.br/login.asmx",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth ONR",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Auth ONR — Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "function getVar(key) {",
                  "  const fromEnv = pm.environment.get(key);",
                  "  if (fromEnv !== undefined && fromEnv !== null && String(fromEnv).length > 0) return fromEnv;",
                  "  const fromCollection = pm.collectionVariables.get(key);",
                  "  if (fromCollection !== undefined && fromCollection !== null && String(fromCollection).length > 0) return fromCollection;",
                  "  const fromGlobals = pm.globals.get(key);",
                  "  if (fromGlobals !== undefined && fromGlobals !== null && String(fromGlobals).length > 0) return fromGlobals;",
                  "  return pm.variables.get(key);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "function hasBasicAuthConfigured() {",
                  "  const auth = pm.request.auth;",
                  "  if (!auth || auth.type !== 'basic' || !Array.isArray(auth.basic)) return false;",
                  "  const user = auth.basic.find((x) => x.key === 'username')?.value;",
                  "  const pass = auth.basic.find((x) => x.key === 'password')?.value;",
                  "  return Boolean(user && pass && !String(user).includes('{{') && !String(pass).includes('{{'));",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "const required = [",
                  "  'SUBJECTCN', 'ISSUERO', 'PUBLICKEY', 'SERIALNUMBER', 'VALIDUNTIL',",
                  "  'CPF', 'EMAIL', 'IDParceiroWS'",
                  "];",
                  "if (!getVar('N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER') || !getVar('N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD')) {",
                  "  if (!hasBasicAuthConfigured()) {",
                  "    required.push('N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER', 'N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD');",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "const missing = required.filter((k) => !getVar(k));",
                  "if (missing.length) {",
                  "  throw new Error(",
                  "    'Variáveis ausentes ou desabilitadas: ' + missing.join(', ') +",
                  "    '. Defina no Environment (checkbox ativo) ou em Collection Variables.'",
                  "  );",
                  "}",
                  "const endpoint = getVar('ONR_LOGIN_ENDPOINT') || pm.collectionVariables.get('onr_login_endpoint');",
                  "pm.variables.set('onr_login_endpoint_resolved', endpoint);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "let json;",
                  "pm.test('Resposta JSON válida', () => {",
                  "  json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.be.an('object');",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('sucesso');",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('status_http');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status_http).to.eql(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (!json) return;",
                  "",
                  "if (!json.sucesso) {",
                  "  pm.test('sucesso=true', () => {",
                  "    throw new Error(`Falha: [${json.codigo_erro}] ${json.mensagem_erro || ''}`);",
                  "  });",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Tokens retornados', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.tokens).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.tokens.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (json.id_usuario != null) pm.environment.set('onr_id_usuario', String(json.id_usuario));",
                  "if (json.id_instituicao != null) pm.environment.set('onr_id_instituicao', String(json.id_instituicao));",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set('onr_tokens', JSON.stringify(json.tokens || []));",
                  "",
                  "const tokenIndex = parseInt(pm.environment.get('ONR_HASH_TOKEN_INDEX') || '0', 10);",
                  "const token = (json.tokens || [])[tokenIndex] ?? (json.tokens || [])[0];",
                  "pm.environment.set('onr_token', token || '');",
                  "console.log('Tokens:', (json.tokens || []).join(', '));",
                  "console.log('Token selecionado (índice ' + tokenIndex + '):', token);",
                  "",
                  "const chave = pm.environment.get('ONR_SERVENTIA_CHAVE');",
                  "if (chave && token) {",
                  "  const hash = CryptoJS.SHA1(chave + token).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex).toUpperCase();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('onr_hash', hash);",
                  "  console.log('onr_hash (SHA-1 chave+token):', hash);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.warn('Defina ONR_SERVENTIA_CHAVE no ambiente para calcular onr_hash.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"assunto_certificado\": \"{{SUBJECTCN}}\",\n  \"emissor_certificado\": \"{{ISSUERO}}\",\n  \"chave_publica\": \"{{PUBLICKEY}}\",\n  \"numero_serie_certificado\": \"{{SERIALNUMBER}}\",\n  \"validade_certificado\": \"{{VALIDUNTIL}}\",\n  \"cpf\": \"{{CPF}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\",\n  \"id_parceiro_ws\": {{IDParceiroWS}},\n  \"url_login_onr\": \"{{onr_login_endpoint_resolved}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{n8n_base_url}}/{{n8n_webhook_mode}}/{{n8n_webhook_id}}",
            "description": "Chama o webhook n8n que valida CPF, monta o SOAP `LoginUsuarioCertificado` e retorna JSON com `Tokens[]`.\n\n**Autenticação:** Basic Auth (variáveis `N8N_BASIC_AUTH_USER` / `N8N_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD`).\n\n**Modo teste:** use `n8n_webhook_mode=webhook-test` e clique *Execute workflow* no editor n8n antes de enviar.\n\n**Produção:** altere para `webhook` e ative o workflow."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Auth ONR — CPF inválido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('sucesso=false por CPF inválido', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.sucesso).to.eql(false);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status_http).to.eql(400);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.codigo_erro).to.eql(2);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('tokens vazio', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.tokens).to.be.an('array').that.is.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"assunto_certificado\": \"{{SUBJECTCN}}\",\n  \"emissor_certificado\": \"{{ISSUERO}}\",\n  \"chave_publica\": \"{{PUBLICKEY}}\",\n  \"numero_serie_certificado\": \"{{SERIALNUMBER}}\",\n  \"validade_certificado\": \"{{VALIDUNTIL}}\",\n  \"cpf\": \"12345678901\",\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\",\n  \"id_parceiro_ws\": {{IDParceiroWS}},\n  \"url_login_onr\": \"{{ONR_LOGIN_ENDPOINT}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{n8n_base_url}}/{{n8n_webhook_mode}}/{{n8n_webhook_id}}",
            "description": "Testa a validação de CPF do workflow (dígitos verificadores inválidos). Espera `CODIGOERRO: 2` sem chamar a ONR."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Auth ONR — CPF ausente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('sucesso=false por CPF ausente', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.sucesso).to.eql(false);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status_http).to.eql(400);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.codigo_erro).to.eql(15);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"assunto_certificado\": \"{{SUBJECTCN}}\",\n  \"emissor_certificado\": \"{{ISSUERO}}\",\n  \"chave_publica\": \"{{PUBLICKEY}}\",\n  \"numero_serie_certificado\": \"{{SERIALNUMBER}}\",\n  \"validade_certificado\": \"{{VALIDUNTIL}}\",\n  \"cpf\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"{{EMAIL}}\",\n  \"id_parceiro_ws\": {{IDParceiroWS}},\n  \"url_login_onr\": \"{{ONR_LOGIN_ENDPOINT}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{n8n_base_url}}/{{n8n_webhook_mode}}/{{n8n_webhook_id}}",
            "description": "Testa CPF vazio. Espera `CODIGOERRO: 15` (O CPF nao foi informado)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Webhook n8n — proxy de login ONR com validação de CPF."
    }
  ]
}
